          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It varies widely by charger and capacity, from around half an hour on a rapid charger with a small pack to several hours on a standard charger with a large one. A pack that suddenly charges much faster than it used to has lost capacity, which is an ageing signal rather than good news."
          }
        },
